        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "# Jet & Sail Rentals\n\nBareboat and skippered rentals from Grand Cul-de-Sac lagoon: RIBs, small sailboats and kayaks.\n\n## Rentals\n\n- RIB 5.5 m, 90 hp (6 people), licence required — €380 per day, €240 per half day\n- RIB 7 m, 200 hp (8 people), with skipper — €850 per day\n- Hobie Cat 16 — €60 per hour\n- Double kayak — €25 per hour\n- Stand-up paddle — €20 per hour\n\nFuel is extra on bareboat rentals. Life jackets and a cooler are included.\n\n## Hours\n\nEvery day 8:30am–5:30pm, November to August. Closed in September and October.\n\nBook by WhatsApp: +590 690 00 41 23 or online at https://www.bookingkit.example/jet-and-sail\n\nThe base has been run by Antoine Lecler since 2012.\n\nJet & Sail Rentals, Grand Cul-de-Sac, 97133 Saint-Barthélemy\n\nWe take cards and cash. English and French spoken.\n\n© Jet & Sail Rentals · Terms"
